  "title": "Take a Look Inside the GR GT’s Aluminum Chassis—a Toyota First",
  "summary": "With no Toyota emblems anywhere to be found, the GR GT is the first car by the automaker to be marketed solely under the Gazoo Racing brand. That’s not the only groundbreaking step for the car; perhaps most notable is its extensive use of aluminum in the chassis. Toyota gave spectators at the Rolex Monterey […]",
